"title": "Vote for Crimson Desert at the Golden Joystick Awards 2026!",
"utc": "2026-10-08T11:00:00Z",
"body": "![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2026/10/08/0779e4386d620261008082050708.jpg)\nWe're delighted to announce that Crimson Desert has been nominated for **PC Game of the Year** and **Best Soundtrack** at the Golden Joystick Awards 2026!\nThis nomination wouldn't have been possible without you, Greymanes.\nIf you'd like to support us, you can cast your vote and find more details through the link below.\n\n### Vote Here\n\n### ※ Voting ends October 23rd (16:00 PT / 23:00 UTC).\n\nThank you again for being part of this adventure with us!"
