"body": "Fellow Greymanes,\nHere are the fixes and improvements that have been added this patch.\n\n## Update Schedule\n\nThe patch is rolling out across all platforms.\nPlease refer to the Update section below to see the state of the patch for each platform.\n\n### Update\n\nSteam (PC): Patch available now\nSteam (Mac): Patch available now\nPlayStation: Patch available now\nXbox: Patch available now\nEpic Games Store: Patch available now\nMac App Store: Patch available now\n\n## Patch Details\n\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\n- Fixed an issue where speaking to an NPC while the lantern was lit delayed the opening of the interaction menu.\n- Fixed an issue where housing items placed in game version 1.12.00 or earlier were not displayed.\n- Fixed an issue where the game would unexpectedly close after launching in certain situations.\n- Fixed an issue where certain areas were displayed incorrectly on the map.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- For known issues, please check the notice below:\n  - [[Crimson Desert Known Issues]](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=68)\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Report an Issue](https://pearlabyss.info/crimsondesertreport)\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment End\nWe are truly rooting for the journey that awaits you in Pywel.\nThank you!"
