"body": "Fellow Greymanes,\nHere are the fixes and improvements that have been added this patch.\n\n## Major Updates\n\nThis patch adds various bug fixes and stability improvements.\n\n## Update Schedule\n\nThe patch is rolling out across all platforms.\nPlease refer to the Update section below to see the state of the patch for each platform.\n\n### Update\n\nSteam (PC): Patch available now\nSteam (Mac): Patch available now\nPlayStation: Patch available now\nXBOX: Patch available now\nEpic Games Store: Patch available now\nMac App Store: Patch available at a later time (in-progress)\n\n## Main Improvements\n\n## Content\n\n- Fixed an issue where certain bosses would appear transparent during battle.\n- Fixed an issue where crops would stop growing in certain situations.\n- Fixed an issue where crops could not be harvested in certain situations.\n- [Oongka/Damiane] Fixed an issue where the lock status of equipped gear would not be saved.\n- Fixed an issue where the player could not attack while riding the quest objective bear to the village, during the \"Scattered Honey Jars\" quest.\n- Changed the location of the \"Mace of Ambition\" so that it can be obtained more easily.\n- Fixed an issue where a large fish carried on the player’s back would disappear when collecting fish from a fish trap.\n\n## Controls\n\n- Fixed an issue where the crosshair for \"Axiom Force\" would appear even when the target was outside its activation range.\n- Fixed an issue where, in certain locations, the camera would remain zoomed in while swimming.\n\n## Combat / Action\n\n- Fixed an issue where the Wyvern could not be summoned while in midair.\n- Fixed an issue where \"Aerial Roll\" traveled an unusually short distance when used after \"Aerial Maneuver.\"\n\n## Graphics / Settings\n\n- Fixed an issue where the colors and transparency of certain UI elements would appear abnormally when HDR was enabled.\n\n## Localization\n\n- Fixed various localization errors and improved localization quality across all languages.\n\n## Others\n\n- Fixed an issue where the game would occasionally crash when loading the cross-save data.\n- Fixed an issue where the character's posture would appear unnatural while riding a mount.\n- Fixed an issue where wagons would occasionally disappear when using the \"Escape\" function with stolen wagons.\n- Fixed an issue where Kliff would partially sink into the ground when using \"Blinding Flash Finisher\" on a slope.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- For known issues, please check the notice below:\n  - [[Crimson Desert Known Issues]](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=68)\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)FAQ](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=63)[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Report an Issue](https://pearlabyss.info/crimsondesertreport)\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment End\nWe are truly rooting for the journey that awaits you in Pywel.\nThank you!"
