"title": "Vote for Crimson Desert at the 2026 World Soundtrack Awards",
"utc": "2026-07-02T09:00:00Z",
"body": "Crimson Desert has been longlisted for the 2026 World Soundtrack Awards (WSA) Game Music Award. We are honored to have been selected to be included in such amazing company, and would like to thank all our fans who have been enjoying the OST since its release.\nThe WSA Game Music Award is an audience-voted award, with nominees selected from the longlist through public voting, open until August 15, 2026, at 23:59 (CEST). We would truly appreciate your vote, so if you’d like to show your support, take a look at how you can vote below!\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Vote for Crimson Desert at the World Soundtrack Awards](https://www.worldsoundtrackawards.com/news/vote-for-the-wsa-public-choice-game-music-awards-2026)\n**Voting Period:** Until August 15, 2026, at 23:59 (CEST)\n**How to Vote**\n1. Log in to your MyFFG account on the World Soundtrack Awards website.\na. If you do not have an account, you can easily create one on the website.\n2. Go to the Game Music Award voting form and cast your vote.\nb. You can also find the voting form under the “WSA Public Choice & Game Music Award” tab in your MyFFG account.\n\n### And a word of thanks from the team behind the Crimson Desert OST:\n\n“This album is the fruit of creative toil and perseverance. Through its rich sound, we have brought to life Pywel’s vast horizons and its most poignant moments. To the players wandering the wilds and crossing paths with destiny, may this music be your steadfast companion. We poured our hearts into the music of Crimson Desert, and we truly appreciate the community’s support and votes recognizing our work.”\n****Crimson Desert Original Soundtrack Volume 1,****\n**AVAILABLE FOR FREE ON:**\nTemplate BTN - Dark With Img Start [alt 수정 필요 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/crimsondesert/sns_steam.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 SEO 텍스트](https://store.steampowered.com/app/4572870/Crimson_Desert_Original_Soundtrack_Volume_1/) Template BTN - Dark With Img End Template BTN - Dark With Img Start [alt 수정 필요 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/crimsondesert/sns_epic.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 SEO 텍스트](https://store.epicgames.com/en-US/p/crimson-desert-crimson-desert-original-soundtrack-volume-1-024a07) Template BTN - Dark With Img End\n\n### STREAM IT ON:\n\n### SEO 텍스트 SEO 텍스트 SEO 텍스트"
