"body": "We would like to inform you in advance that our Privacy Policy is scheduled to be updated on July 8, 2026 (UTC)\nFor a summary of the upcoming changes, refer to the list below.\n◎ Privacy Policy Update Notice\n- Applicable Services: All services using the Pearl Abyss ID.\n- Effective Date: July 8, 2026 (UTC)\n- Key Changes\n  - Updated the scope of application to reflect the expanded range of services available through the Pearl Abyss ID\n  - Consolidated notices regarding the processing of personal information related to Black Desert and Crimson Desert\n  - Added a new category of personal information collected (providing additional services through account synchronization)\n  - Added and specified details regarding the overseas transfer of personal information\n  - Specified the categories of personal information collected automatically\n  - Specified the rights of data subjects"
