"body": "Fellow Greymanes,\nHere are the fixes and improvements that have been added this patch.\n\n## Update Schedule\n\nPlease refer to the Updates section below to see the state of the patch for each platform.\n\n### Update\n\nSteam (PC): Patch available now\nSteam (Mac): Patch available now\nPlayStation: Patch available now\nXbox: Patch available now\nEpic Games Store: Patch available now\nMac App Store: Patch available now\n\n## Patch Notes Version 1.04.01\n\n- [Controller] Changed the button used to change the names of pets and horses from (R3/RS) to (L3/LS).\n- Fixed an issue where certain owned mounts were not appearing in the Quick Slot, preventing them from being summoned.\n- [PlayStation/Xbox] Changed the \"Change Preset\" option to be displayed the same way as on PC.\n- Fixed an issue where pets would eat wood or ore gathered with a logging axe or pickaxe.\n- [Keyboard/Mouse] Fixed an issue where furniture could not be placed while using housing mode in certain situations.\n- Fixed an issue where crashes could occur while dyeing or changing customization.\n- Fixed an issue where stamina would recover when sheathing and unsheathing certain weapons while sprinting.\n- [Damiane] Fixed an issue where Blinding Flash was canceled in safe zones.\n- [Kliff] Fixed an issue where the flight speed of Focused Aerial Roll became slower than intended.\n- [Oongka/Damiane] Fixed an issue where ranged weapons could not target anything other than bosses during boss battles.\n- Fixed an issue where the game would return to the title screen when observing a skill that had already been acquired by consuming an Abyss Artifact while the inventory was full.\n  - Please note that if you were unable to recover an Abyss Artifact by observing an already acquired skill while your inventory was full, you can recover the Abyss Artifact by using the Reset All function.\n- Fixed an issue where hit effects were displayed when attacking NPCs that could not be attacked while wearing a Mask.\n- Fixed an issue where the game would crash during combat with a certain boss when using a customized character. (To avoid spoilers, the relevant boss is listed in the dropdown menu below.) Umbra\n\n### Known Issues\n\n- For known issues, please check the notice below:\n  - [[Crimson Desert Known Issues]](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=68)\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)FAQ](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=63)[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Report an Issue](https://pearlabyss.info/crimsondesertreport)\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment End\nWe are truly rooting for the journey that awaits you in Pywel.\nThank you!"
