"body": "To celebrate the launch of Crimson Desert, we’re kicking off a two-week Twitch Drops event, starting from launch.\nDuring the Drops period, watch participating Crimson Desert streams on Twitch and earn special rewards, including an outfit set, accessories, and horse tack pieces.\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2026/03/15/cde4532340920260315084011719.png)* Twitch Drops rewards cannot be dyed.\n\n| **Week 1** | **Week 2** |\n| --- | --- |\n| **March 19, 23:00 – March 25, 23:59 UTC** March 20, 00:00 – March 26, 00:59 CET March 19, 16:00 – March 25, 16:59 PT | **March 26, 00:00 – April 1, 23:59 UTC** March 26, 1:00 – April 2, 00:59 CET March 25, 17:00 – April 1, 16:59 PT |\n\nFor more details on how to claim your Twitch Drops, please check the link below.\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)View Event Details](https://event.pearlabyss.com/CrimsonDesert/Drops)"
