"body": "![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/0b7c8f814a920241213043628443.jpg)\nCrimson Desert is coming to Steam, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S and Mac in late 2025!\nWishlist Crimson Desert on Steam now with the button below or through the console platform of your choice and always be the first to get Crimson Desert news.\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/4e5fad388b720241213060639925.png)](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3321460?utm_source=official_notice&utm_campaign=tga&utm_medium=gl&utm_content=notice&utm_term=notice) **![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/9a1a602d94d20241213062002770.png)**\n\n### WATCH THE NEW TRAILER FROM THE GAME AWARDS 2024\n\n**![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/9a1a602d94d20241213062002770.png)**\n**The saga of Pywel, a continent swept by war for unprecedented power, begins late 2025.**"
