"utc": "2024-09-13T00:00:00Z",
"body": "We are following up on the 4 boss battle trailer reveals from gamescom 2024 with a new video showcasing 50 minutes of early Crimson Desert gameplay.\nIn the vast wilderness of the continent Pywel, Kliff, captain of the Greymanes, embarks on a quest to reunite his scattered comrades and fulfill the group's mission.\nExperience part of Kliff's journey in this Crimson Desert 50-minute early gameplay video.\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n* This gameplay video consists of different parts of Crimson Desert’s early gameplay and has been edited to help viewers’ understanding.\n* Additionally, this video contains actual in-game footage. As a work-in-progress, the content is subject to change."
