"title": "Crimson Desert Boss Battle Gameplay Trailers (gamescom 2024)",
"utc": "2024-08-21T00:00:00Z",
"body": "Watch Crimson Desert’s gameplay trailers from gamescom 2024, featuring fights against four bosses.\nThe first to be unleashed on August 19th was the mountain spirit White Horn. The three bosses that follow are Staglord, a fallen king sitting upon a forsaken throne, Reed Devil, a slum-dweller of Hernand attempting to rewrite his fate, and the Queen Stoneback Crab, a monster adorned with the rarest gems of Pywel.\n* These gameplay trailers contain actual in-game footage from Crimson Desert's gamescom 2024 demo build. As a work-in-progress, the content is subject to change.\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
